// 기존AI가있는경로와battle0반환만실제Session에서확인하고AI전략/소유자이전/공격은실행하지않는다.
TEST_CASE(CampaignSession_MakeAiUsesExistingBrainAndBattleZeroWithoutFrames) {
    const auto& assets=netstorm::test::dudespawn::Assets(OriginalEdition::Patch1078);SessionServicesFixture external;auto services=external.Services();services.ai.allocationBytes=[](auto raw) { std::fill(raw.begin(),raw.end(),std::uint8_t{0x71}); };services.ai.participation.clearChat=[](auto) {};services.ai.participation.addChat=[](auto,auto,auto) {};services.ai.assertion=[](std::string_view text) { throw std::logic_error(std::string(text)); };
    auto fort=FortTemplate::Parse(assets.files.Read("d/thewarbegins.fort"),assets.game.TypeTable());RawCampaignSession session(assets.game,assets.files,std::move(fort),"thewarbegins",std::move(services));const auto oldBattle=session.Core().ownerMode.battle;session.Core().ownerMode.battle=false;session.MakeAi(2);session.Core().ownerMode.battle=oldBattle;session.Load();
    CHECK(session.LocalOwner()==1);if (session.LocalOwner()!=1) return; //입력맵이바뀌면owner0양성이전경로를실행하지않고검사실패를유지한다.
    const auto token=session.CreateAi(2,SessionAiSettings("Existing manual AI","sunCannon"));CHECK(token && session.Participation().Brain(2)==token);if (!token || session.Participation().Brain(2)!=token) return; //setup실패를실제owner0이전실행으로바꾸지않는다.
    const auto before=std::vector<std::uint8_t>(session.AiMemory().Bytes(token).begin(),session.AiMemory().Bytes(token).end());const auto memory=session.AiMemory().Allocations().size(),packets=external.packets.size();const auto sp=session.Sp(session.LocalOwner());const auto now=session.Core().processState.now;
    session.MakeAi(2);session.MakeAi(0);CHECK(session.Participation().Brain(2)==token && std::equal(before.begin(),before.end(),session.AiMemory().Bytes(token).begin()) && session.AiMemory().Allocations().size()==memory && external.packets.size()==packets && session.Sp(session.LocalOwner())==sp && session.Core().processState.now==now);session.RemoveAi(2); //owner0의후보local+1=2에기존brain이있어실제이전/삭제는실행하지않는다.
}
